NOTE ON THE ADJACENT DEPOSIT

The Zenodo deposit "ScientificDiscoveryLab: Three Instrument Defects Found by
Self-Audit" contains a curated subset of this material under the same MIT
licence. This repository is the superset: the full laboratory record across all
investigations, including code and results not in the deposit. Neither
supersedes the other; they are the same work at different scopes.

No physics discovery is claimed anywhere in this repository. See
`AUDIT/DO_NOT_CLAIM.md` and `CURRENT_STATUS.md`.